Changes:
 rustc-1.96 (1.96.1+dfsg-24.04.0ubuntu1) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Rebase Ubuntu rustc packaging onto upstream 1.96.0.
   * Retain existing Debian/Ubuntu packaging customizations pending patch refresh.
   * d/p/ubuntu/ubuntu-libgit2-1.7.patch: use noble's system libgit2 for
     offline builds instead of falling back to pruned vendored sources.
   * Prefer rust-stage0-1.95 as the offline bootstrap toolchain.
